---
// Concept 11: anchor for the section-cut line. It paints nothing; its only job is to
// create the `cut-line` view-transition group, which view-transitions.css draws and
// animates. (WebKit does not paint off-viewport elements into snapshots, so the line
// cannot live in this element's pixels; see docs/decisions/0002.)
---

<div class="cut" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .cut {
    position: fixed;
    inset-block: 0;
    inset-inline-start: calc(var(--vt-cut-width) * -1);
    inline-size: var(--vt-cut-width);
    pointer-events: none;
    view-transition-name: cut-line;
  }
</style>
